      "message": "fix(2d): keep the part only where a whole-model pocket clears around it\n\nWith no stock set up a whole-model pocket source is still the volume to\nremove (#12's reading needs a stock), so DepthLaw::Keep stands down\nthere (GenJob::around_part) - the tilt suite's parked pocket.\n\nThree fixtures ran a stock-source pocket through a part and asserted a\nsilent verify; each was a real cut into the part (#1603 / #1554):\npost_not_judged and machine_switch now leave the part standing under\nthe pocket, and lead_approach asserts the gouge on the user's part and\nreads the entry laws on the rest.\n\nRefs #1603\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
